+/* Base configuration for all QNX Neutrino targets.
+   Forward-ported to GCC 16 from the bigunclemax/gcc qnx_11_2 port for the
+   QNX 6.5.0 cross-toolchain (see gcc16-port/README.md).  Differences vs
+   the 11.2 fork: -stdlib=/nto-cxx.c machinery dropped (LIBSTDCXX default is
+   already "stdc++"), CPLUSPLUS_CPP_SPEC dropped, DBX/stabs defines dropped
+   (removed upstream in GCC 13).
